{"4135570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "4x4 in a Furniture Store", "steam_appid": 4135570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO 'KAGU' FURNITURE STORES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;4x4 in a Furniture Store&quot; is a physics-based off-road/rock crawling game that takes place entirely in a mini open world furniture store.  Each customer represents a unique precision driving challenge, help them all and perhaps you can finally become employee of the month!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/407ff67d78cc4fcc10dbd0070d885577.poster.avif?t=1787801393\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/407ff67d78cc4fcc10dbd0070d885577.webm?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/407ff67d78cc4fcc10dbd0070d885577.mp4?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMERS NEED YOUR HELP!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are spread throughout the store, and they all need your help!  Drive up to them and honk your horn to accept their mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/55673234ad5f6bfda603967b8d5bd32c.poster.avif?t=1787801393\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/55673234ad5f6bfda603967b8d5bd32c.webm?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/55673234ad5f6bfda603967b8d5bd32c.mp4?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MISSION TYPES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different types of driving challenge missions, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floor is lava: drive through checkpoints without touching the floor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Stars: touch all the stars in an area in any order, and using whatever means necessary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Topple Objects: knock over specific objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tires on Objects: perform a series of specific maneuvers to get your tires to rest on target objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragile Items: deliver fragile items without dropping or breaking them</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/7183b90673bdb3318c26577497d073f0.poster.avif?t=1787801393\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/7183b90673bdb3318c26577497d073f0.webm?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/7183b90673bdb3318c26577497d073f0.mp4?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR VEHICLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trusty 4x4 comes equipped with several useful features to assist you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High gear for driving swiftly around the store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low gear for maximum power and traction when crawling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered doors you can open and close with the press of a button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An emergency extending boxing glove</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and when these aren't enough, simply grab onto the frame and SHAKE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/378baceeb9d786aa8218c6d10e26bd5a.poster.avif?t=1787801393\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/378baceeb9d786aa8218c6d10e26bd5a.webm?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/378baceeb9d786aa8218c6d10e26bd5a.mp4?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden blizzard means YOU are the only employee of mega furniture store KAGU to show up to work today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are in need of assistance- get out there and help them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's that?  You're not in customer service, you're just a driver?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well then <strong>DRIVE</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO 'KAGU' FURNITURE STORES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;4x4 in a Furniture Store&quot; is a physics-based off-road/rock crawling game that takes place entirely in a mini open world furniture store.  Each customer represents a unique precision driving challenge, help them all and perhaps you can finally become employee of the month!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/407ff67d78cc4fcc10dbd0070d885577.poster.avif?t=1787801393\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/407ff67d78cc4fcc10dbd0070d885577.webm?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/407ff67d78cc4fcc10dbd0070d885577.mp4?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMERS NEED YOUR HELP!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are spread throughout the store, and they all need your help!  Drive up to them and honk your horn to accept their mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/55673234ad5f6bfda603967b8d5bd32c.poster.avif?t=1787801393\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/55673234ad5f6bfda603967b8d5bd32c.webm?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/55673234ad5f6bfda603967b8d5bd32c.mp4?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MISSION TYPES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different types of driving challenge missions, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floor is lava: drive through checkpoints without touching the floor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Stars: touch all the stars in an area in any order, and using whatever means necessary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Topple Objects: knock over specific objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tires on Objects: perform a series of specific maneuvers to get your tires to rest on target objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragile Items: deliver fragile items without dropping or breaking them</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/7183b90673bdb3318c26577497d073f0.poster.avif?t=1787801393\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/7183b90673bdb3318c26577497d073f0.webm?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/7183b90673bdb3318c26577497d073f0.mp4?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR VEHICLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trusty 4x4 comes equipped with several useful features to assist you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High gear for driving swiftly around the store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low gear for maximum power and traction when crawling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered doors you can open and close with the press of a button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An emergency extending boxing glove</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and when these aren't enough, simply grab onto the frame and SHAKE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/378baceeb9d786aa8218c6d10e26bd5a.poster.avif?t=1787801393\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/378baceeb9d786aa8218c6d10e26bd5a.webm?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/extras/378baceeb9d786aa8218c6d10e26bd5a.mp4?t=1787801393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden blizzard means YOU are the only employee of mega furniture store KAGU to show up to work today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are in need of assistance- get out there and help them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's that?  You're not in customer service, you're just a driver?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well then <strong>DRIVE</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "4x4 off-road physics-based precision driving in a mini open world mega furniture store", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/811be25a5fec06b88dc10f35660592a49a51ac41/header.jpg?t=1787801393", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/65b60dd573995f8a26556d55f97a53f1b9f72eb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787801393", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135570/65b60dd573995f8a26556d55f97a53f1b9f72eb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787801393", "website": "https://www.walaber.com/4x4", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_32 CPU with SSE2 instructions, or any x86_64 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:<